    <!-- =================================================
         INTRO
         ================================================= -->

    <p>
      Iceland had been sitting on the list for a while.
      Eventually the only reasonable thing to do was
      stop talking about going and actually go.
    </p>

    <p>
      A rental car, a pile of camera gear, too many
      snacks, and a rough idea of where we were going
      was about all we had when we landed.
    </p>


    <!-- =================================================
         OPTIONAL IMAGE 02
         ================================================= -->

    <!--

    <img
      src="../images/iceland-02.jpeg"
      alt="Road through Iceland"
      class="trip-image"
