      the road ahead · 2024
    </div>

    -->


    <!-- =================================================
         DAY / SECTION
         ================================================= -->

    <p>
      The first few days were mostly about driving.
      The landscape changed constantly, and every time
      we thought we had seen the best part, the road
      would turn a corner and prove us wrong.
    </p>

    <p>
      We didn't really have a strict schedule. If
      something looked interesting, we stopped.
      If a road looked like it went somewhere,
      we took it.
    </p>


    <!-- =================================================
