    <p>
      Somewhere along the way the trip stopped feeling
      like a vacation and started feeling like an
      adventure.
    </p>

    <p>
      Maybe it was the weather. Maybe it was the empty
      roads. Maybe it was realizing that we had no idea
      what was waiting around the next corner.
    </p>


